PTX splitk-fence-red-cumulative+no-fence
"Variant of splitk-fence-red-cumulative without the fence.acq_rel.gpu before the relaxed red. CUTLASS keeps the fence (barrier.h:123). Expected: allowed."
{
w=0;
l=0;
P2:r0=0;
P3:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P2@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P3@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak.global w, 1      | bar.sync 1, 2            | ld.acquire.gpu r0, l     | bar.sync 1, 2            ;
 bar.sync 1, 2            | red.relaxed.gpu.add l, 1 | bar.sync 1, 2            | ld.weak.global r1, w     ;
exists
(P2:r0 == 1 /\ P3:r1 == 0)
